# ============================================================================
# Editorial factory (Sprint 7) — never commit raw source materials.
# These are large (often copyrighted) PDFs that must stay local. The pipeline
# (`pnpm editorial-factory`) reads them and writes only structured output to
# the database; the source files themselves stay out of version control.
# ============================================================================
materials/
materials-inventory.md
editorial-results-*.md
scraping-cache/

# Editorial factory build artifacts
PROMPT_COMPRESSION_REVIEW.md
